{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17mini_level_act17mini_st06",
  "groupId": "act17mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "罐头里有什么",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17mini/level_act17mini_st06.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e561cc97a084d6013e01e428a72e80040e3248ea0a37d894228339b98f83e099",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃米埃米，收到请回答，收到请回答~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃米......怎么不灵了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这位笞心魔小姑娘，能先把我的手解开吗？我保证不跑——至少让我先抽支烟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行！把你送回大熔炉之前我是不会解开的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的认错人了。虽然我本来就打算去一趟大熔炉，但我确实不是从那里面逃出来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的上衣口袋里有哥伦比亚签发的身份证件，我可以拿给你看——只要你解开我的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从哥伦比亚跑到卡兹戴尔来，要挺久的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但凡你说自己是从雷姆必拓来的，我也许都信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃米，听得到吗？喂，喂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个箱子里的通讯术式构造已经被破坏了，你再怎么拍它也是修不好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还好意思说！都怪你，把我的手提箱给撑坏了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那如果我帮你修好这个小箱子，你能解开这条锁链吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你真能修好？\n你可不许耍赖！我、我有的是办法对付你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了，小笞心魔。放心，不需要你劳神，我绝对不会乱跑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等会儿，妮芙你不会当真了吧？这可是个被死......被老祖宗附身的家伙，你真要给他解开？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老插嘴的小朋友，你对死魂灵和笞心魔都不够了解。如果说有谁绝对不会被死魂灵干扰到心智，那这人一定是位笞心魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我先给你解开一只手......欸！你怎么就挣脱了！你骗人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就知道你不怀好心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两只手被绑了这么久，实在难受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这副铁皮身躯，也会疼吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是铁，是锡。疼倒不疼，就是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "金属打造的指关节灵巧地夹住一根香烟，那根香烟仿佛是凭空出现的。\n凑近嘴边深吸一口后，怪人将香烟在指间打了个转，然后把每一颗火星都仔细地摁灭在掌心里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咻——舒服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在卡兹戴尔可买不到这种级别的卷烟，得省着点儿抽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你答应了我要修好手提箱的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骗你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "里面的术式出自巫妖之手，那些骄傲的家伙从来不会将可维修性纳入设计的考虑范围内，不过他们中的一些，也的确有骄傲的资格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说这么多，不还是耍赖吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听我说完。你的目的不是找人吗？虽然修不好它，但我帮你找到那个造出它的巫妖不就行了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你怎么知道我要找的是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道呀，不过好像也不需要知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "怪人头向后仰，灰白色的烟雾从他的口中缓缓吐出。\n灰雾如云弥散，亦如投石于一潭死水，属于死魂灵的印痕波动席卷而出，整座卡兹戴尔似乎都在一瞬间陷入寂静。\n片刻后，嘈杂声重新涌来，那团灰雾也彻底消散不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您......到底是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叫我锡人就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锡人......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看，你要找的人来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行走于大地的死魂灵屈指可数，您又是其中哪一位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他说他叫锡人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他说他从哥伦比亚来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......卡兹戴尔没有为您备下位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不怪你，我离开这里时的确没想过自己还有回来的一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您想要什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他说他想去大熔炉看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妮妮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道啦~你问你问，我不插嘴了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么请问......算了，好像也没什么要问的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按理说，您这种级别的客人，我得去找我老师来接待才是，不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的老师不会是那个倔老头子吧？那还是别告诉他了，否则我这假期就算是彻底报废了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果您想去魂灵熔炉底下看看的话，我可以带您去，不会让别人知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摇头）我想进去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还能有谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妮妮，死魂灵碎片都找齐了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都装在这个手提箱里了，给！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年轻的巫妖点了点头，随手将有些变形的箱子丢进了身后的阴影中。\n她的目光在笞心魔和死魂灵的身上来回移动，最后越过他们的肩头，落向远处矗立着的魂灵熔炉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我们就走一趟吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妮妮，这次的报酬我会挑时间给你送过去，另外，答应你的神秘惊喜也该揭晓了——不知道你想不想进大熔炉里面逛一逛呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我可以带朋友进去吗？这一路上多亏了好心人帮忙，不然我没办法这么快就把碎片都找齐的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，实不相瞒，我从小就想进大熔炉里去，看看它是怎么运转的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......反正今天坏的规矩也不止一条了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你等我一会儿，我去把他们都叫来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“他们”？等一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，给我的报酬能不能换成报废的异铁零件......珀耳，就拜托你替我给埃米解释一下了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年轻人真是有劲儿啊，两三步就蹿出去那么远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还没来得及自我介绍。我来自“底下”，也就是人们常说的贫民窟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里的人们叫我“顾问”，我替他们说话。锡人先生，还有这位巫妖女士，你们叫我珀耳就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别叫我女士。你不觉得这样很不礼貌吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，年轻人......有些方面还是太年轻了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_undergroud_u_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一、二、三、四，还有我，一共五个人，都到齐了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妮妮，大熔炉里是很危险的，你怎么带这么多人来？还有藏在你后面的那个小孩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小樱桃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一张儿童票，谢谢姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里不是旅游景点，也不卖票！小孩子不许进！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，小樱桃，我尽力了......要不还是下次吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有下次了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小樱桃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀没事，妮芙姐姐。我还以为大炉子和我们那儿的小炉子一样贴满了面饼呢，结果又黑又脏的，没劲透了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么面饼，我们从来不会在节点炉上乱烤东西吃的，小樱桃你可别乱说！你爷爷还在外面等着呢，快去找他吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还剩下这么多人，怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃米，他们都帮了我很大的忙，你刚才答应过我的！他们绝对不会给你添麻烦的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妮妮代表不了所有人，我需要你们亲口保证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克伦妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1453_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我无所谓，我只是想瞻仰一下那位传奇设计师留下的痕迹——据说魂灵熔炉的蓝图上也有她的签名，是真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魂灵熔炉什么时候有一份蓝图了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到处看看可以，但别乱摸。那你呢，石翼魔，你在张望什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是有条足够宽的管道能一直通往城外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "石翼魔总是对这些复杂的建筑系统感兴趣，你放心，她只是在评估管道够不够结实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，主要还是得看能不能从中间爬过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你呢，顾问先生，还是像你之前说的那样，仅仅是为了实现小时候的愿望吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摊手）这个理由还不够充分吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你居然也来了，卡莱莎。一位脱离了族群的食腐者，你为何来此？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡莱莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "脱离族群？不，我只是和他们在理念上有所不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡莱莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于我为何来此......嗯，主要是这位可爱的小姑娘盛情邀请，我难以拒绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡莱莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是能在魂灵熔炉中学习到一些高深的巫术仪式，那自然更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡莱莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这里的人应该都没有撒谎的必要，更何况，邀请我们来此的是一位笞心魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一根烟都抽完了，你们怎么还没报完数？难道有人食言了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小巫妖，你可不要跟你老师学那些坏毛病。想当初巫妖的诚信可是有口皆碑的，现在嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我对于历史钻研不深，但也听得出来您在乱说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了好了，准备好我们就出发。跟紧我，别掉队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好耶！埃米你最好啦~就知道你不会像那些死板的老古董一样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下一个路口，右拐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "往前三步的地面上有破洞，贴着左侧走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以睁开眼睛了，我们到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "52_mini03_sarkazfurnace"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来里面是这个样子！那个模模糊糊在发光的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡莱莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巫术核心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡莱莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里就是魂灵熔炉的最深处了。据我所知，自熔炉建成起，只有巫妖会涉足此地，举行安抚死魂灵的仪式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而最近的一场安抚仪式，就炸出了将我们带领至此的大烟花。埃芒加德小姐，您有什么要吩咐的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锡人先生，那就还是按我们之前说的来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题，我帮你看着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那朵烟花是个意外，安抚仪式也并未完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我老师让我去找散落在卡兹戴尔的死魂灵碎片，我将这个任务托付给妮芙，妮芙又受了你们的帮助，这么说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我老师欠你们一个人情，不对，是欠“咱们”一个人情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身为知识圣殿的看守人，他的人情可是很值钱的，可以用来做很多事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过我作为老师的学生，已经擅自替他决定了将这个人情用来做一件很困难很困难的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有预感你会说出一些很恐怖的话来......我现在还可以走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行！我邀请你来的，要走，也得是我先走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，其实也没什么大不了的，你们都被她唬住了。她被那个倔老头子训了一顿，心里憋着气呢，现在想让你们帮忙找回场子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么场子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死魂灵的......场子。我要将老师没能完成的安抚仪式，漂漂亮亮地给办成了。你们干还是不干？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克伦妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1453_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克伦妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1453_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我只是受不了这种尴尬的沉默......随便弄点什么动静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克伦妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1453_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我也说过了，我其实只是想进来参观一下那位传奇设计师的手笔......现在都看完了！什么死魂灵的就交给你们吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一路上都没让我们睁眼，你怎么就看完了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡莱莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果只是旁观一场安抚仪式那倒还好，不过看这位巫妖的意思，似乎是想让我们也参与其中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和死魂灵打交道的话，是不是得让阿米娅也知道一下？还有巴别塔的那几个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们能聚集到此，一路上或多或少都见识了死魂灵的厉害之处，即使只是一小块碎片也能把卡兹戴尔闹得不得安宁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "珀耳，你不要再冒冷汗了！根本没有你说得那么夸张啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夸张？妮芙，你仔细想一下，随便哪一块碎片，要是我们去得再晚些，会发生什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些混帮派的刺头的刀拔出来就要见血，发疯的巨像可收不住挥出去的拳头......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更何况，现在要我们直面那些在大熔炉里燃烧了几百年的死魂灵，其中的风险，仅凭我们就能承担吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说了我会照看着你们的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡莱莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一位死魂灵。一位背弃故乡又贸然回归的，强大的死魂灵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡莱莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1452_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样的话，我没意见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也没意见！有这么厉害的老祖宗保佑我们，还怕什么呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妮芙，你是不是有些太激动了？就算有锡人先生帮衬着，也很难靠我们几个就把老祖宗们哄开心吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么就很难了？我们一路上见到了这么多人，大家的日子虽然苦了些，但不都活得很有劲头吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许，上一次仪式没能成功，也是因为老祖宗们听腻了唠叨，每次都是那些未来啊牺牲啊之类的话，怎么可能打得起精神来嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是我们能给老祖宗们讲讲，现在卡兹戴尔的人们究竟是怎么生活的，说不定老祖宗们也会多些劲头呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，死魂灵们说不定还记得那位传奇的设计师，知晓她的真实身份......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克伦妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1453_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这事听着就靠谱，算我一个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都走到这儿了，总不能空手回去。要是能从死魂灵那里问出城里的秘密通道之类......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也算你一个！珀耳，你还在犹豫吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽说有些冒险，但也想不出来绝对不能这么做的理由。算上我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那我们就一起给老祖宗们办一场不一样的安抚仪式吧！锡人先生，您觉得呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有意思，我之所以答应那个小巫妖，也是因为她说了和你差不多的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，真的吗？埃米......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡兹戴尔未来的道路，是由我们来走的，不是他们。所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我们当然有资格做这些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "捂住耳朵，我要开始念咒语了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再试一次吧。放松心神......有缺的魂灵，靠近，请予我回应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "于火中......连血脉也销熔......请予我回应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么回事，一点反应都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锡人先生，您还在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g12_diving"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走得有些太深了......得不到任何回应，是我哪一步没做对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，现在回头的话就等于提前宣告失败了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无边无形的幽影中，透着寒意的光点围绕我的意识旋转，划出层层叠叠的轨迹。\n一旦试图去理解其中的规律，就会立刻迷失。停下。想起来，想起来......\n这些......是死魂灵的碎片。我想起来了。我试着将它们聚拢成一堆，可它们就像星光的碎屑，总是从我疏漏的缝隙溜走。\n他们在说话。一个，两个。很多声音慢慢靠近我。寒冷的感觉退去，坚冰熊熊燃烧，我感受到了——\n躁动。恨意。混乱......他们并非没有听到我的呼喊，他们只是......无视了我。终于，他们觉得烦了。\n他们要......撕碎我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉静的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "后退......三，二，一。断开你的感知，往后退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "52_mini03_sarkazfurnace"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃米！你还好吗？你刚刚一直站在原地发抖，好吓人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我没事，锡人先生呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他就在那儿，靠着墙低着头，好久没动了，不知道在想什么，也不知道那些金属关节会不会酸痛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仪式成功了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才，我将碎片还给大熔炉，却差点迷失在死魂灵的意识中，是锡人先生救了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搭把手而已，算不上救。凭你自己的本事也能搞定，只是会多花些时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他明明在那里没有动，怎么......这声音好像是直接在我脑子里响起来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年轻人有冲劲是好事，可你潜得太深了，最好还是有我这种老家伙站在岸上看着，时不时分享一点经验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，死魂灵们还是没有回应我的呼唤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒也在我意料之中，在炉子里这么多年，他们的脑子都被烧坏了，不对，他们早就没有脑子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个心机很深的小家伙，对，就是你。帮我个忙，从我上衣内侧的口袋里把那个笔记本拿出来，顺便再拿几支笔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不会在我凑近的时候突然醒来掐住我的手吧？恐怖故事里一般都是这么写的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没那么无聊。把笔记本拿出来后，你们可以把自己想对死魂灵们说的话写在上面，然后撕下来烧掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打火机在我裤兜里，或者用法术点燃也一样，没区别的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样，他们就能接收到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总要给我点面子。是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "写什么都可以，不过我建议你们写点儿他们会感兴趣的内容——喂，你们对什么感兴趣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就卡兹戴尔吧。写完，撕下来，烧掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您现在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遇到个熟悉的家伙，聊上两句，不用担心我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我写好啦！埃米，帮我变个火球出来好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种源石技艺你自己不就......算了，还有谁写好了要一起烧掉的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用了，我找到打火机了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妮芙，你写了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘘——愿望说出来就不灵了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是许愿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感觉到了吗？大熔炉似乎在震动......我看到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老祖宗们显灵了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？其实，他当时也找到了我，但我没和他一起走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看见他身上的骨，叮当作响。其中有你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你还能认出我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们有理由恨，我有时也恨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就当是看看老朋友吧。在哥伦比亚待久了，已经习惯了每天睁眼看见一堆新鲜的玩意儿。但有时候还是会想起旧事，想起老朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，就给自己放个假，回来看看。几百年了，听说卡兹戴尔又一次重建，也确实好奇会是什么样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说他们很快就要重修这座大炉子了，到时候会举办一场庆典，把你们全都放出来。哈哈，不知道你还撑不撑得到典礼的那天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死魂灵，早就死了，但仍需要一场葬礼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。我知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥伦比亚有些地方的葬礼上会讲笑话，就是拿死去的人开玩笑，大家笑完就忘了哭了。我觉得这样的习俗挺好，应当得到推广。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚好遇到些有趣的孩子，各自藏着些有趣的想法，你们都来听听看。就当是提前排练一下自己的葬礼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过也别吓着他们，这些......都是卡兹戴尔的好孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "52_mini03_sarkazfurnace"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......才一会儿，怎么腿就僵住了。得抽空去保养一下关节部件了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？我打火机呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被那个心机很深的小子拿走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感觉到了吗？大熔炉似乎在震动......我看到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老祖宗们显灵了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妮芙，小心！站到我这边来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克伦妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1453_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不光是未来吧......我写的其实算是些传说故事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克伦妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1453_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些佣兵讲得有模有样的，我又没办法反驳，就想着刚好向你们求证一下，是不是真有一座卡兹戴尔掉到地下去，只剩下个大深坑了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克伦妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1453_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会是诅咒呢？如果那地方是真的，我也想去一趟，说不定真能挖到些失落的宝贝，拓展我的风格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克伦妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1453_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的个展标题都定好了，“失落的卡兹戴尔，来自古老年代的回响”，多有范儿啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "历史上那么多座卡兹戴尔，其中真有一个不小心塌掉了也......\n呃，我乱说的，您别生气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珀耳",
      "speakerId": "avg_4147_mitm_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可是正经写的对卡兹戴尔未来的展望，绝对不是那种离奇的胡话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吗？我来看看......“在一个全新的卡兹戴尔，萨卡兹互相帮助，外族人也不必再挤在城外”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“人们来到这里只为更好地生活，无论种族，也没有王庭”。珀耳，这是你写的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这、这是我写的呀！我不是都烧掉了吗，您怎么知道的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论种族......没有王庭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能看到我写的是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能看到。嘶......你的构想相当大胆，石翼魔，但这构想也许注定无法实现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样的话在很多年前就有很多人讲过，很多很多年前，对另一位石翼魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）埃米埃米，现在是安抚仪式的哪一步了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪一步都不是。从老祖宗显灵的那一刻起，我就已经彻底失去了对这场仪式的掌控。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在这一切给我的感觉就是，老祖宗们在拿我们逗趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妮芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_4146_nymph_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "逗趣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老祖宗们似乎想听些“不一样的故事”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "掉进地底的，飞到天上的，没有王庭的，还有整座城都变成死魂灵的......你们可真敢想啊。难道你们就真觉得......"
